- File edited:
  - `TM4C129E_Project/xTask/xSource/xTask9_TFT.c`
- Scope of this slice:
  - Rule 8.7 one-function file-scope objects.
  - Rule 17.4 pointer-arithmetic style issues in button checks and DMA end-address setup.
  - Rule 12.1 precedence-sensitive DMA destination-end expression.
  - Rule 10.3 integer-to-pointer cast sites in DMA ISR helpers.
- Changes applied:
